rname>Leirisalo-Repo</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reactive arthritis or post-infectious arthritis?</article-title><source>Best Pract Res Clin Rheumatol</source><year>2006</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>419</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16777574</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.berh.2006.02.003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mackie</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Keat</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Poststreptococcal reactive arthritis: what is it and how do we know?</article-title><source>Rheumatology</source><year>2004</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>949</fpage><lpage>954</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15150434</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/rheumatology/keh225</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rogerson</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Beeching</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reactive arthritis complicating group G streptococcal septicaemia</article-title><source>J Infect</source><year>1990</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>155</fpage><lpage>158</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2319147</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0163-4453(90)93470-D</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Madhuri</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Mathai</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Brahmadathan</surname><given-names>KN</given-names></name><name><surname>Korula</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>John</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An outbreak of post-streptococca